# Quest drops (mod-quest-drops): Graverobbers (358) asks for 8 Embalming Ichors, which Rot Hide
# Graverobbers drop at 40%. With the module every one of them has one while the quest needs it: five
# kills, five Ichors (at 40%, five of five would happen about once in a hundred tries).
cmd .levelup 9
cmd .quest add 358
go 0 2515.8 538.4 34.6
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
kill-loot 1941
expect loot item 2834
# Out of the fight, so the character can log out.
cmd .combatstop
wait 2
